    <p>
        The final phase of the CRP Project focuses on knowledge translation (KT): taking all our research findings and
        turning them into practical, accessible guidance for CRPs, policymakers, and others with vested interest in this
        work.
    </p>

    <p>
        Our Advisory Board will lead an Expert Review Process to refine findings from Studies 1–3 and ensure
        recommendations are practical, evidence-based, and relevant to the field.
    </p>
